      <h1 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-weight:500; font-size:38px; color:#142B24; margin-top:56px;">Policies</h1>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:24px; color:#1E3D33; margin-top:36px;">Delivery</h2>
      <p style="line-height:1.75; font-weight:300;">Deliveries are made monthly on your chosen date throughout Palm Beach County, beginning no sooner than two days after your order. We carry your cases inside, place them where you keep your water, and remove empty glass bottles from your previous delivery. Someone does not need to be home if we have standing instructions for access or a covered drop location.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:24px; color:#1E3D33; margin-top:36px;">Pausing &amp; changes</h2>
      <p style="line-height:1.75; font-weight:300;">Traveling or closing the house for the season? Write us at least two days before your delivery date and we will hold your subscription, with no charges, until you return. Case counts and selections can be adjusted anytime and take effect on your next delivery.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:24px; color:#1E3D33; margin-top:36px;">Cancellation &amp; refunds</h2>
      <p style="line-height:1.75; font-weight:300;">Cancel anytime with two days' notice before your next billing date — no fees, no questions. If a delivery ever arrives damaged or short, tell us and we will replace it or credit it in full.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:24px; color:#1E3D33; margin-top:36px;">Payments &amp; privacy</h2>
      <p style="line-height:1.75; font-weight:300;">Payments are processed by Stripe; we never see or store your card details. We collect only what a delivery requires — your name, address, phone, and email — and never sell or share it. Billing occurs monthly on the anniversary of your first order.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:48px; color:#5B6D66; font-size:14px;">Questions — hello@sorgentepb.com</p>
    </div>
